landisk_aux_probe -- binary=/tmp/gxland533_bins/base
live           0x9      0x9      ring fill sets DRQ: status 0x09 -- the ring is live, so 0x01 elsewhere is the reset ok
aux 2c rest    0x9      0x9      0x2c answers with STATUS (0x09) -- device signature; pre-fix unmapped reads 0x0 ok
aux 206 gone   0x0      0x0      0x206 is UNMAPPED on landisk: pre-fix 0x09; kills a register-BOTH mutant ok
aux 2c reset   0x1      0x1      SRST at 0x2c PURGES the ring: status 0x01; pre-fix the store is lost, stays 0x09 ok
aux 2c read    0x1      0x1      0x2c then reads the post-reset status 0x01 -- same device, same value ok
206 ctl dead   0x9      0x9      SRST at 0x206 must land NOWHERE: status stays 0x09; pre-fix it purged (0x01) ok
LANDISK_AUX_RESULT=6/6
LANDISK_AUX_VECTOR=1,1,1,1,1,1
LANDISK_AUX_DONE
